  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"e3FOF\" id=\"e3FOF\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubec07505\" id=\"ubec07505\">为什么要做 muduo？</span></h2><ul list=\"u08a984a5\"><li fid=\"u0f7cb07a\" data-lake-id=\"u286250f9\" id=\"u286250f9\"><span data-lake-id=\"udee5d6cb\" id=\"udee5d6cb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">通过学习muduo网络库源码，一定程度上提升了linux网络编程能力;</span></li><li fid=\"u0f7cb07a\" data-lake-id=\"u89e3a01d\" id=\"u89e3a01d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u86e5c3bd\" id=\"u86e5c3bd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">熟悉了网络编程及其下的线程池，缓冲区等设计，学习了多线程编程;</span></li><li fid=\"u0f7cb07a\" data-lake-id=\"u7a65661a\" id=\"u7a65661a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u97e6dd6a\" id=\"u97e6dd6a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">通过深入了解muduo网络库源码，对经典的五种IO模型及Reactor模型有了更深的认识</span></li><li fid=\"u0f7cb07a\" data-lake-id=\"ud60f0770\" id=\"ud60f0770\"><span data-lake-id=\"u21146ae8\" id=\"u21146ae8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">掌握基于事件驱动和事件回调的epoll+线程池面向对象编程。</span></li><li fid=\"u0f7cb07a\" data-lake-id=\"ud58d5687\" id=\"ud58d5687\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5c6c47b0\" id=\"u5c6c47b0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">还有一点我觉得比较重要就是学习完你可以自行去根据自己需求替换，知识星球的Raft项目、webServer项目、Rpc项目。然后自己再进行拓展这就把自己学习过的知识串通起来了。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"JuhN7\" id=\"JuhN7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u08c5a63b\" id=\"u08c5a63b\">理论部分</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u2db58115\" id=\"u2db58115\"><span data-lake-id=\"u017bccaf\" id=\"u017bccaf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">这里提及一下如果多Reactor模型不熟悉的录友：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ueab5beef\" id=\"ueab5beef\"><span data-lake-id=\"u16f96915\" id=\"u16f96915\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">强烈推荐：</span><a href=\"https://xiaolincoding.com/os/8_network_system/reactor.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uc511e925\" id=\"uc511e925\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua614f896\" id=\"ua614f896\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">https://xiaolincoding.com/os/8_network_system/reactor.html</span></a></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"jzHFf\" id=\"jzHFf\"><span data-lake-id=\"uef63b0c3\" id=\"uef63b0c3\">结果图片及分析：</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u52384765\" id=\"u52384765\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F47188040%2F1737382594415-701abdf4-682f-4c22-af19-d49410d78a18.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u2d0abfa8-b5ac-447f-812c-bc72965b6cc%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u0beee915-c49f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A1493%2C%22height%22%3A640%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A70468%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1493%2C%22originHeight%22%3A640%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22stroke%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3Anull%2C%22y%22%3A0%2C%22width%22%3Anull%2C%22height%22%3A543%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22F0%5D55057351%2F06%2F1313%3A27%3A26%3ATCPCONNECTION%3ADTOR%5BECHOSERVER-127.0.0.1%3A8801%5DATFD-12STATE%3D%22%2C%22x%22%3A8%2C%22y%22%3A610%2C%22width%22%3A664%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3Anull%2C%22y%22%3A0%2C%22width%22%3Anull%2C%22height%22%3A427%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3Anull%2C%22y%22%3A0%2C%22width%22%3Anull%2C%22height%22%3A495%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3Anull%2C%22y%22%3A0%2C%22width%22%3Anull%2C%22height%22%3A70%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3Anull%2C%22y%22%3A0%2C%22width%22%3Anull%2C%22height%22%3A106%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3Anull%2C%22y%22%3A0%2C%22width%22%3Anull%2C%22height%22%3A527%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3Anull%2C%22y%22%3A0%2C%22width%22%3Anull%2C%22height%22%3A324%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TNFO155057351%2F04%2F3021%3A42%3A25%3ACHANNE1HANDLEEVENTREVENTS%3A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A0%2C%22y%22%3A204%2C%22width%22%3A429%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INF0155057351%2F06%2F1313%3A26%3A26%3AFUNC%3DREMOVECHANNE1%3EFD-